# MySports environment contract (docs/deployment-contract.md §4). Copy to .env; never commit .env.
# <PASSWORD> is a placeholder (angle brackets keep it outside the commit secret gate); replace it with the mysports_writer password, no brackets.
CFBD_API_KEY=
